  "scientific_review": [
    "All four original January15/July15,2022 Greenland cases retain all28 section anchors,source positions/profile and diagnosis pointers,exact primary lower depths,paired spans,frames,scopes and effective gates. Every unselected,selection-edge,support-edge or censored primary node remains explicit. Source arrays and diagnostic results remain byte-pinned through facts,review,manifest and actual-orientation transport ledger.",
    "East Greenland180degree southward and West Greenland0degree northward frames remain fixed through depth with primary10cm/s,surface>5cm/s and complete finite upper200m signed-integral selection. First western native index breaks ties. Complete support can exclude shallow shelf flow;latitude sections are not independently flow-normal or full current widths. Broad velocity maxima do not independently identify coastal/slope currents,bathymetric axes,water masses,overflow/return Atlantic flows or detached eddies. Same-sign deep layers do not imply one coherent physical current.",
    "Fresh SchillerWeiss2023 publisher text distinguishes outer/slope EGC from EGCC and EGC/Irminger merging south of64N.78.5N to59N is regional study geography,not a complete Arctic pathway or exact Cape Farewell coordinate.1000m shelf edge,upper200m freshwater integration,salinity reference and mooring sample limits do not define current bottoms. Fresh Gou2022 distinguishes WGC/WGCC,northward/westward bifurcation and surface Arctic/deeper Atlantic layers.500m pathway isobath and top50m mean are not thickness.59.4–67N northward branch is an editorial regional convention,not the full system.",
    "Frozen v18 source-to-reference and v12 adjacent-only interpolation preserve every original section and gap. Only adjacent eligible source anchors support assumed interpolation. No qualifying column yields explicitly unsampled gate-midpoint reference geometry without depth or profile claims. No gap skipping,extrapolation,alternate-cutoff filling,weaker interior substitution or seasonal sign flip occurs. Connector lengths are not independently measured current lengths.",
    "All76 earlier supported scenarios,historical unresolved cases,every previous CSV cell and all canonical ownership lists remain preserved under cloud checks. Immutable v14 base and eight previous addenda remain byte-pinned;inventoryv9 adds one pinned addendum/CSV without expanding a full JSON snapshot or increasing publication caps. Frozen source/selection/layer/geometry operators and previous data remain unchanged.",
    "Eleven cloud projection checks cover all original anchors/cases,source values/positions/pointers,opposite source frames,effective gates/scopes,unselected geometry accounting,selection/primary censoring gaps,adjacent interpolation,source mutation rejection,piece/input/count integrity,prior cases/CSV cells/ownership and no physical/annual promotion. The fixed-latitude transport ledger is pinned with actual latitude_index/longitude_indices_inclusive labels and full-target budgets. Six canonical baseline checks passed on the same exact code commit.",
    "All retrieval,retries,selection/geometry/contour/interpolation,inventory reconstruction and tests ran sequentially in the cloud on one idle CPU. Local work reviewed source text/metadata,prepared code,verified hashes and retained exact cloud artifacts. No local numerical ocean-field processing/tests or runtime/UI/browser work occurred. Source and result pieces honor unchanged file/inline/aggregate caps.",
    "Two exact snapshots do not establish monthly means,annual extrema,seasonal envelopes,confidence intervals or independent observations. Model threshold spans remain qualified regional diagnostics,not water-mass boundaries or full physical current thickness. No complete physical whole-route depth,matched width-depth area,physical current volume,state join or global total is admitted. Broader coverage,observational/seasonal validation and runtime/query integration remain unfinished."
